Event "1" *-- "*" Registration
Registration "*" -- "1" User : attendee >
Event "1" *-- "*" WaitingListEntry
WaitingListEntry "*" -- "1" User : attendee >
Event "1" -- "0..1" AttendeeEventDetails
(Event, User) .. RegistrationSettings
AttendeeEventDetails ..> Notification : one event_changed per active registration

note bottom of Registration
  One active registration per attendee per event (partial unique
  index on status <> 'cancelled'). Every place-holding write locks the
  event row first, so the last place is decided one attempt at a time.
  Registration is open for a confirmed event that needs registration,
  from opens_at (inclusive) to closes_at (exclusive).
end note

note bottom of WaitingListEntry
  First come first served; one active (waiting or offered) entry per
  attendee per event. A withdrawal or a capacity increase offers the
  freed place to the first waiting attendee for waitingListResponseHours
  (or until registration closes); an unused offer lapses and passes on.
end note

